# Privacy Policy
Privacy Policy
Privacy Policy

Last updated: August 14, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how A&P/AMT Prep ("we", "our", or "the App") collects, uses, and discloses information when you use the mobile application.

1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT

The App is designed to work entirely offline. We do not require you to create an account, and we do not collect, store, or transmit any personal information that identifies you, such as your name, email address, phone number, or postal address.

The App does not collect or transmit your study progress, quiz answers, bookmarks, or any other usage data to our servers. All of this data is stored locally on your device only.

2. THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

The App does not integrate any third-party advertising networks, analytics services, crash reporting tools, or tracking SDKs. We do not sell, rent, or share your information with any third parties.

3. INTERNET AND PERMISSIONS

The App functions completely offline and does not require an Internet connection to operate. The Internet permission declared by the App is used solely to support core platform services and is not used to transmit your personal data.

4. DATA SECURITY

Because all your data is stored locally on your device, no data is at risk of interception during transmission over the network. We encourage you to keep your device and operating system up to date and to use the built-in security features of your device.

5. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY

The App is a study tool intended for adults preparing for aviation maintenance technician certification. It is not directed to children under the age of 13, and we do not knowingly collect any personal information from children.

6. CHANGES TO THIS PRIVACY POLICY

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this policy. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.

7. CONTACT US

